It includes the tool, skill and policy bundles of open-robot-skills
(https://github.com/graph-robots/open-robot-skills), copyright the
graph-as-policy authors, taken from commit
752dfbd96968d4d08379f8111765efbf6457800b. Each bundle keeps the license its
SKILL.md declares, Apache-2.0 or MIT, and its metadata.hub.provenance.code
links the upstream directory it came from.

This repository changed them: it added metadata.hub to every SKILL.md, a
license line to the ten that relied on the upstream repository's Apache-2.0,
and resolves the engine by pinned URL in each pyproject.toml instead of by a
relative path. Later changes are in this repository's git history.

